# app router conventions

- keep route shells in `app/*/page.tsx` and shared chrome in `components/dashboard/*`.
- use `Sidebar` and `Header` for screens that match `app/page.tsx` and `app/analytics/page.tsx`.
- wire route actions with `next/navigation` only inside `use client` pages like `app/tasks/page.tsx`, `app/logout/page.tsx`, `app/chat/page.tsx`, `app/clients/page.tsx`, and `app/team/page.tsx`.
- keep page text in pt-br to match the rest of the app.
- prefer `Button` from `components/ui/button.tsx` for page actions such as `+ Novo Caso` and `Exportar Relatório`.
